 
 
 
 

 
app   fastapi title  tagged api example  


 app users   tags   users    public users id   1   name    alice      id   2   name    bob   


 app post   users   tags   users    admin create user name  str id   3   name   name 


 app admin stats   tags   admin    internal admin stats total users   100   active sessions   25 


 app health   tags   public health check status    healthy  


 app metrics metrics requests   1000   errors   5 main   
     

    print      example 1  make admin-tagged routes tools      

     
    mcp1   fastmcp fastapi 
        app app 
        route maps  
            routemap methods      pattern r      mcp type mcptype tool  tags   admin    
            routemap methods pattern r      mcp type mcptype resource  
          
     

    tools mcp1 list tools  
    resources mcp1 list resources  

    print f tools   len tools           join t name t tools    
    print f resources   len resources           join str r uri r resources    

    print  \n    example 2  exclude internal routes      

     
    mcp2   fastmcp fastapi 
        app app 
        route maps  
            routemap 
                methods      pattern r      mcp type mcptype exclude  tags   internal  
              
            routemap methods pattern r      mcp type mcptype resource  
            routemap methods   post    pattern r      mcp type mcptype tool  
          
     

    tools mcp2 list tools  
    resources mcp2 list resources  

    print f tools   len tools           join t name t tools    
    print f resources   len resources           join str r uri r resources    

    print  \n    example 3  pattern   tags combination      

     
    mcp3   fastmcp fastapi 
        app app 
        route maps  
             
            routemap 
                methods     
                pattern r    admin     
                mcp type mcptype tool 
                tags   admin   
              
             
            routemap 
                methods      pattern r      mcp type mcptype tool  tags   public  
              
            routemap methods pattern r      mcp type mcptype resource  
          
     

    tools mcp3 list tools  
    resources mcp3 list resources  

    print f tools   len tools           join t name t tools    
    print f resources   len resources           join str r uri r resources    

    print  \n    example 4  multiple tag condition      

     
    mcp4   fastmcp fastapi 
        app app 
        route maps  
             
            routemap 
                methods     
                pattern r     
                mcp type mcptype tool 
                tags   users    admin   
              
            routemap methods pattern r      mcp type mcptype resource  
          
     

    tools mcp4 list tools  
    resources mcp4 list resources  

    print f tools   len tools           join t name t tools    
    print f resources   len resources           join str r uri r resources name         main    
    asyncio run main   
  examples tags example